ed_at":"2025-10-13T08:39:58Z","updated_at":"2025-10-13T08:39:58Z","body":"I guess `cat` or `stack` are not supported for NJT on dimension 0 because it would require merging batches by concatenating and re-indexing the offsets and reconciling metadata (e.g., contiguous invariants, ragged_idx) across inputs. Handling mismatched ragged structures and validating cross-batch constraints is nontrivial, and I am not sure whether the current jagged path has implemented it or not. BTW, dimension 1 is the ragged dimension (symbol as `j1` when you print the shape), so `vstack` is also not supported in your case. For more information, you can check this out here: https://docs.pytorch.org/docs/stable/nested.html#data-layout-and-shape.\n\nBut the error message shows another problem. The schema could theoretically accept only one input for `cat` and `stack` since `dim` is optional. I would like to raise a pr to fix it.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pytorch/pytorch/issues/comments/3396440338/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"can-gaa-hou","id":59080187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDgwMTg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/59080187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou","html_url":"https://github.com/can-gaa-hou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/can-gaa-hou/repos","events_url":"https:/